# Part of sys-strength: Oreburgh Gate B1F, boulder 3 at (8, 19). Walking into it before Strength does
# not move it; after Strength from the party menu (FIELD_MOVES 10) a push moves it one tile west. The
# `strength-*` screenshot lines are the browser spec's key beat (the boulder drawn where it is).
give badge platinum:BADGE_ID_MINE
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_BIBAREL 30 platinum:MOVE_STRENGTH
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_OREBURGH_GATE_B1F 9 19 left
until idle
